com,"to Johnny Evers and the Cubs claimed the out, which"
com,"was not allowed by umpire Hank O'Day; the Cubs"
com,"protested the game since that out would have ended"
com,"the inning and negated the run (precursor to famous"
com,"Merkle game later in the month)"
